<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#142238"><title>Report a lost item | Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><header class="site-header"><nav class="nav-wrap" aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg" alt="Sherubtse College crest"><span><strong>Sherubtse</strong><small>Lost &amp; Found</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">☰</button><div class="nav-links"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/browse">Browse items</a><a class="active" href="/report-lost">Report lost</a><a href="/report-found">Report found</a><a href="/my-items" data-auth-link hidden>My posts</a><a href="/about">About</a></div><div class="nav-account" data-account></div></nav></header><main class="page-main form-page"><section class="form-intro"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Lost item report</span><h1>Tell us what went missing.</h1><p>Include details that help someone recognise it. Do not publish passwords or sensitive account information.</p></section><form id="item-form" class="report-panel"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="lost"><div class="form-two"><label>Item name<input name="title" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Blue water bottle" required></label><label>Category<select name="category" required><option value="">Choose a category</option><option>Electronics</option><option>ID cards &amp; wallets</option><option>Bags</option><option>Books &amp; notes</option><option>Keys</option><option>Clothing</option><option>Sports equipment</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div><label>Description<textarea name="description" required rows="4" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Colour, brand, distinctive details, or contents"></textarea></label><div class="form-two"><label>Last seen at<input name="location" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Library, Academic Block" required></label><label>Date lost<input name="itemDate" type="date" required></label></div><label class="file-field">Add a photo (optional)<input name="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><small>JPG, PNG, or WebP, up to 2 MB.</small></label><label class="check-line"><input name="phonePublic" type="checkbox"><span>Show my phone number on this listing so people can contact me.</span></label><p class="form-notice">Your name and course are shown with the listing. Your phone is shown only if you tick the box. Your college email is visible to signed-in students.</p><button class="button button-navy" type="submit">Post lost item <span>→</span></button><p class="form-message" id="form-message" role="status"></p></form></main><footer class="site-footer"><div><a class="footer-brand" href="/">Sherubtse College Lost &amp; Found</a><p>Kanglung, Trashigang, Bhutan</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/browse">Browse listings</a><a href="/my-items">My posts</a></div><small>Student community project · 2026</small></footer></body></html>
